# ResumeMatch Day 1 & Day 2 Implementation Plan

This plan details the implementation for the first two days of the ResumeMatch 7-Day Data Science Product Sprint, focusing on building a production-ready core NLP engine and a clean, separated Streamlit interface.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **User Review Required**: Please review the finalized structure and approach below. If you are satisfied with this plan, please approve it so we can begin execution!

## Decisions Made
- **Testing**: Using `pytest` and `pytest-cov` for testing and coverage.
- **PDF Extraction**: Sticking with `pdfplumber` for the MVP.
- **Architecture**: Strict separation between the NLP engine and the UI components. `app.py` handles UI only, delegating all logic to `src/analysis.py`.

